{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1059461/block/singleImage/3244007/wm/01M3GZYPG0ENTA8JRHYFT8XYA6.jpg?updatedAt=1792555346\"/><figcaption>啟德簡約公屋兩歲女嬰暈倒家中 母親急報警 (資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>啟德簡約公屋有女嬰暈倒。 今日（21日）早上7時35分，啟德世運道20號簡約公屋一名兩歲女嬰暈倒，其母親發現後連忙報警求助。警方和救護員接報後趕至現場，將女嬰送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救，女嬰其後轉醒。警方列作「病人」案件調查。據了解，女嬰身患疾病。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:34.206907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:16:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:57:44.369923+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:53.277825+00:00","content_hash":"10924d2decaee4850f563c0aaf109bbf50c81d3f6a78c6af3fcf50166b2f07eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}